[E0411] Error: `&` can only be written where a reference is expected
    ╭─[ err/46_reference_expressions/main.wip:26:17 ]
    │
 26 │     val pair = (&moving, 1)
    │                 ───┬───
    │                    ╰───── `&` where no reference is expected
    │
    │ Help: use the value directly, or keep it in a local: `val r = &place`
    │
    │ Note: a `&` reference is an argument, a view's field, a variant's payload, a local's value or an assignment to one
